  "body": "## Summary\n\n`/readyz` 200/503 and `/api/processes/batch-experiment` 200 previously documented descriptions without JSON response contracts. Add schemas for their existing fields, readiness flag/status relationships, sanitized dataset errors, and exact batch discovery values and limits.\n\nShared response fixtures are compared with the real Go handlers and validated against OpenAPI. Negative tests reject missing fields, wrong types, invalid discovery values, and unsanitized errors.\n\n## Linked issue\n\nCloses #85.\n\n## Affected surfaces\n\nOpenAPI documentation, backend handler contract tests, shared JSON fixtures, and generated changelog/search documentation.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] Backend: `go vet ./...` and `go test -race ./...` passed.\n- [x] Focused handler tests: `go test . -run 'TestOperationalResponseContractFixtures|TestReadiness' -count=1` passed.\n- [x] Documentation: `python -m unittest discover -s docs -p '*_test.py'` passed (14 tests).\n- [x] Strict schema validation: `python docs/validate_openapi.py` passed (42 paths).\n- [x] References rebuilt with `sh docs/build-reference-pages.sh` using pinned Pandoc 3.10.\n- [x] `python docs/validate_docs.py`, `python docs/validate_claims.py`, `python3 scripts/versioning.py check`, and `git diff --check` passed.\n- [x] Frontend and adapter checks skipped because those surfaces are unchanged.\n\nPython documentation commands used an isolated environment installed from the pinned, hash-verified `docs/requirements.txt`.\n\n## Screenshots (UI changes only)\n\nN/A.\n\n## Boundary notes (RF / scope / persistence / compatibility changes)\n\nNo production handler, status behavior, RF math, budget, experiment limit, or persistence changes. These are operational discovery contracts and introduce no RF evidence class.\n\n## Changelog\n\nRecorded under Unreleased in `CHANGELOG.md`; regenerated the changelog page and search index.\n",
